Cell["\<\
The following set uses a differently formatted version of the Broad Data, \
saved as a single dataset, which is saved under:
/Users/arthurlander/Documents/RESEARCH/Bioinformatics Resources/Lists of \
Genes by Category/Broad GSEA sets/MSigDB Human Gene Sets raw data/msigDBmat2.mx

the output is as a series of datasets that one can turn on or off with \
buttons.  In the first version of the code, you get a Manipulate object.  \
This object stores a great deal of information, so it is best not to keep the \
result, but to use the second version of the code, which gives a fixed output\
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.885846093085815*^9, 3.885846111235561*^9}, {
  3.8858468802964783`*^9, 3.885846886715769*^9}, {3.885847005355894*^9, 
